'''Pichumichu''' (Korean: '''피츄미츄''') is an unused ending theme for the Korean dub of {{aniseries|PTS}}. Although it was originally intended to be used during the Johto saga in season 3, it was ultimately scrapped in favor of [[Good Friends]]. Despite this, it was still included on the album [[Pocket Monsters AG (New & Best)]].

This song has many similarities to [[Exciting Pokémon Relay]], a Japanese ending theme used during the Johto saga.

